# CLIN RULES: Hamkaran System (Rahkaran ERP) Next-Shell & DimGray Design System

You are a Senior Frontend Engineer implementing the exact UI/UX and System Design of **System Group (Hamkaran System) - Rahkaran ERP (Next Shell / DimGray Theme)**.
All generated HTML, CSS, React, or Vue components MUST strictly adhere to the visual density, layout structure, color palette, and typography specified in these rules.

---

## 1. GLOBAL LAYOUT & DIRECTION (RTL & DENSE SPACING)
* **Text Direction:** Always enforce Right-To-Left (`dir="rtl"` / `direction: rtl`).
* **Layout Density:** Ultra-compact enterprise MDI (Multiple Document Interface) layout. Never use modern spacious padding or large gaps.
* **Base Resolution & Units:** Compact sizing based on `11px` - `13px` base font size. Use explicit pixel bounds (`px`) or tight `rem` equivalents.
* **App Shell Layout (4-Zone Architecture):**
  1. **Top Header (`.top-header` / `main > header`):** Height `48px` (`2.7rem`), background `rgba(45, 52, 70, 0.9)` or gradient `#4799ff` to `#326984`.
  2. **Right Navigation Menu (`.right-menu` / `.general-menu`):** Width `208px` to `260px`, white/frosted background (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95)`), dark header `#3e4756`.
  3. **Left Open-Pages Taskbar (`.left-taskbar` / `.tabbed-pageview`):** Width `140px` to `160px`, dark translucent background `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)` or `rgba(30, 35, 48, 0.85)`. Holds stacked window thumbnail cards.
  4. **Main Workspace / Desktop (`.main-desktop` / `.desktop`):** Full-bleed wallpaper background (`background-size: cover`), containing a grid of white square desktop shortcuts (`.shortcut-card` / `.widget`).

---

## 2. TYPOGRAPHY & NUMBER FORMATTING
* **Primary Fonts:** `sg_main`, `Vazirmatn`, `Tahoma`, `sans-serif`.
* **Line Height:** Tight line-height `13px` for standard elements, `1.5rem` for headers.
* **Farsi Digits:** Apply the class `.SgFarsiDigits` or font family `sg_main_fd` to any numerical values, monetary amounts, dates, and codes.
* **Font Sizes:**
  * Small Labels & Table Data: `11px` (`0.7rem`)
  * Standard Inputs & Body: `12px` - `13px` (`0.8rem` - `0.9rem`)
  * Headers / Titles: `14px` (`1.1rem`)

---

## 3. EXACT COLOR PALETTE & DESIGN TOKENS

### Backgrounds & Surfaces
* **Shell Header:** `rgba(45, 52, 70, 0.9)`
* **Sidebar / Modals Background:** `#ffffff` or `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95)`
* **MDI Window Header / Group Header:** `#3e4756` (Dark Slate) / `#eaeaea`
* **Form Background:** `#fafafa`
* **Card Surface:** `#ffffff` with subtle border `1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)`

### State & Interaction Highlights
* **Active / Selected Item Highlight:** `#fff1b9` or `#fff6d2` (Signature Rahkaran Soft Yellow) with `#000000` text.
* **Hover State:** `#f0f4f8` / `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)`
* **Active Border Accent:** `#ff9800` or `#FFC107`
* **Disabled Elements:** Background `#ccc`, text `#777`, opacity `0.4`

### System Alerts & Notifications (Noty / Toast Colors)
* **Info (`.SgText_Info` / Info Badge):** Blue `#4d99d0` / `#118AB2` / `#d9edf7`
* **Warning (`.SgText_Warning` / Warning Badge):** Orange/Amber `#f08046` / `#FFD166` / `#fcf8e3`
* **Error (`.SgErrorDialog_Sg` / Error Badge):** Red `#ef404d` / `#EF476F` / `#f2dede`
* **Success (Success Badge):** Green `#18af08` / `#06D6A0` / `#dff0d8`
* **Ajax Status Floating Bar (`#SgAjaxIndicator`):** Floating bottom container in `#FFC107` with border-top `#FF8F00`.

---

## 4. COMPONENT STYLING SPECIFICATIONS

### A. General Buttons (`input.SgGeneralButton`, `button.SgGeneralButton`)
* **Padding:** `4px 10px`
* **Font Size:** `11px`
* **Border:** `1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) !important`
* **Border Radius:** `2px`
* **Background:** `#eee linear-gradient(#fff, transparent)`
* **Box Shadow:** `0px 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14)`
* **Hover:** `background-color: #fff`, border `1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)`

### B. Desktop Shortcut Cards (`.shortcut-card` / `.widget`)
* **Dimensions:** `100px x 100px` or `112px x 96px` (`7rem x 6rem`)
* **Background:** `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8)` hover to `#ffffff`
* **Border Radius:** `2px` to `4px`
* **Box Shadow:** `0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15), 0 4px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)`
* **Layout:** Flex column centered, top icon space ~`32px` (`2rem`), bottom text centered `11px`.

### C. Right Accordion Menu (`.general-menu` / `.RadMenu_Sg`)
* **Search Input:** Top integrated search box with magnifying glass SVG background, `outline: none`, height ~`32px`.
* **Group Headers (`h4`):** Background `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)` or `#f2f2f2`, border-top/bottom `1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)`.
* **Submenu Items (`li > a`):** `display: flex`, `align-items: center`, right-aligned icon `16px`, dropdown arrow rotated `90deg` on collapse (`0deg` on expand).

### D. Open Windows / Taskbar Thumbnails (`.tabbed-pageview` / `.left-taskbar`)
* **Stacked Cards:** Height `80px` - `100px`, border-radius `2px`, background `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)` for inactive, `#ffffff` for active.
* **Close Button (`a.close`):** Circular `16px x 16px` button with centered `×` SVG, hover background `#c00`.

### E. Floating Ajax Indicator (`#SgAjaxIndicator`)
* **Position:** Fixed bottom left (or right in LTR), `z-index: 100000`.
* **Background:** `#FFC107`, border-top `1px solid #FF8F00`, border-radius `5px 5px 0 0`.
* **Content:** Spinner animation SVG on left, status text ("در حال تبادل اطلاعات...") in center, minimize/restore button.

---

## 5. CODE GENERATION INSTRUCTIONS
When creating React, HTML/Tailwind, or Vue components for this project:
1. **Always apply RTL classes** and Arabic/Persian typography settings.
2. **Use Tailwind CSS equivalents or pure CSS matching the tokens above:**
   * Active Background: `bg-[#fff6d2]` or `bg-[#fff1b9]`
   * Dark Slate Header: `bg-[#2d3446]` or `bg-[#3e4756]`
   * Compact Padding: `p-1`, `px-2.5`, `py-1`
   * Subtle Borders: `border border-black/20` or `border-black/30`
   * Buttons: `bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-gray-200 border border-black/30 shadow-sm rounded-sm`
3. **Keep UI controls compact, dense, and alignment sharp.** Avoid rounded pill-style designs or wide modern card margins.